        },
        "text_qmMyhB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We’ve all experienced the frustration of a tangled mess at the bottom of a handbag. That’s why we’ve curated the <strong>best power bank chargers for iPhone</strong> that eliminate the need for extra wires. Whether you’re looking for a magnetic power bank for iphone that snaps directly to the back of your device or a <a href=\"/collections/power-banks\" title=\"Power Banks\"><strong>portable charger</strong></a> apple-ready with built-in connectors, our goal is to keep your life organized. Our branded power bank for iphone series ensures that your tech looks as chic as your outfit.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_NJAJaD": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "MagSafe vs. Plug-in: Which One Suits You?",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_HAi6PX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you value convenience, our best magsafe power bank for iphone models offer a seamless \"snap and charge\" experience. They are perfect for long commutes where you need to use your phone while it recharges. On the other hand, if you prefer a traditional boost, our apple portable charger collection features ultra-compact plug-in designs that are barely larger than a lipstick. For the iPhone 16 early adopters, we’ve ensured all our newest models are optimized for the latest charging standards, providing a <strong>good power bank for iphone</strong> experience that protects your battery health.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
