          }
        },
        "heading_8YayEk": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Travel-Ready and TSA-Compliant",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_GkMCeX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><a href=\"https://rorry.com/\" title=\"rorry\">RORRY</a> As a recommended power bank for iphone brand among travel vloggers, we know that reliability is non-negotiable. Every <strong>apple powerbank</strong> in our shop is airline-approved, making them the perfect companions for your next getaway. If you also carry an Apple Watch, you’ll find that many of our best magnetic power banks for iphone are part of our integrated watch and phone charging station collection. For those who need even more versatility, don't forget to pair your new battery pack with one of our fast-charging wall blocks to ensure you're always ready for the next adventure.</p>",
